flowchart TB
    accTitle: Current webhook delivery architecture
    accDescr: Ingestion buffers events on an event bus. Processing acknowledges on receipt, calls enrichment, stores results, and hands them to delivery. Failed delivery returns to the event bus and repeats processing. Dashboards read the stored results.
    apps[Customer applications] --> gateway[API gateway: authentication and tenant rate limits]
    gateway --> ingestion[Ingestion: validate events]
    ingestion --> bus[(Event bus)]
    bus --> processing[Processing: acknowledge on receipt]
    processing <-->|Synchronous enrichment call| enrichment[Enrichment service]
    processing --> data[(Datastore and search index)]
    processing --> delivery[Delivery service]
    data --> dashboard[Dashboard and API]
    delivery --> endpoints[Customer webhook endpoints]
    delivery -.->|Failed attempt: reprocess event| bus
    classDef risk fill:#fff4db,stroke:#997233,color:#172c3a
    class processing,delivery risk
